{"title":"People","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"People"},"headingText":"People","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.page-hero}\n\nWe are building an interdisciplinary team at the intersection of environmental health, infectious disease epidemiology, microbiology, and quantitative methods.\n:::\n\n## Principal Investigator\n\n::: {.person-grid}\n::: {.person-card}\n<img class=\"person-photo\" src=\"images/Abby Paulos-007.jpg\" alt=\"Photo placeholder for Abby Paulos\">\n\n::: {.person-info}\n### Abby Paulos, PhD\n\n<div class=\"person-role\">Principal Investigator</div>\n\nAssistant Professor of Epidemiology  \nUniversity of Michigan School of Public Health\n\nAbby studies environmental and cross-species transmission of infectious diseases, environmental pathogen surveillance, and One Health epidemiology.\n\n[Email](contact.qmd) · [Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=hB8EjpgAAAAJ&hl=en&authuser=1) · [ORCID](https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9258-6648)\n:::\n:::\n:::\n\n<!--\n## Lab Members\n\n::: {.person-grid}\n::: {.person-card}\n<div class=\"person-info\">\n### Your future lab member\n\n<div class=\"person-role\">Research Staff / Student / Postdoc</div>\n\nAdd a short 2–3 sentence biography, research interests, and links here.\n:::\n:::\n\n::: {.person-card}\n<div class=\"person-info\">\n### Your future lab member\n\n<div class=\"person-role\">Graduate Student</div>\n\nThis layout will automatically expand as the lab grows.\n:::\n:::\n:::\n\n## Collaborators & Affiliates\n\nAdd recurring collaborators or affiliated trainees here if you want them visible on the lab site.\n-->","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.page-hero}\n# People\n\nWe are building an interdisciplinary team at the intersection of environmental health, infectious disease epidemiology, microbiology, and quantitative methods.\n:::\n\n## Principal Investigator\n\n::: {.person-grid}\n::: {.person-card}\n<img class=\"person-photo\" src=\"images/Abby Paulos-007.jpg\" alt=\"Photo placeholder for Abby Paulos\">\n\n::: {.person-info}\n### Abby Paulos, PhD\n\n<div class=\"person-role\">Principal Investigator</div>\n\nAssistant Professor of Epidemiology  \nUniversity of Michigan School of Public Health\n\nAbby studies environmental and cross-species transmission of infectious diseases, environmental pathogen surveillance, and One Health epidemiology.\n\n[Email](contact.qmd) · [Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=hB8EjpgAAAAJ&hl=en&authuser=1) · [ORCID](https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9258-6648)\n:::\n:::\n:::\n\n<!--\n## Lab Members\n\n::: {.person-grid}\n::: {.person-card}\n<div class=\"person-info\">\n### Your future lab member\n\n<div class=\"person-role\">Research Staff / Student / Postdoc</div>\n\nAdd a short 2–3 sentence biography, research interests, and links here.\n:::\n:::\n\n::: {.person-card}\n<div class=\"person-info\">\n### Your future lab member\n\n<div class=\"person-role\">Graduate Student</div>\n\nThis layout will automatically expand as the lab grows.\n:::\n:::\n:::\n\n## Collaborators & Affiliates\n\nAdd recurring collaborators or affiliated trainees here if you want them visible on the lab site.\n-->"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-c